    "sections": {
        "description": "The Vehicle Rental Theme is designed for building websites that manage vehicle listings, reservations, and rental services. It includes a structured layout for displaying cars, bikes, vans, and other transport options with detailed specifications such as pricing, availability, seating capacity, fuel type, and transmission details. The theme supports advanced search and filtering options to help users find suitable vehicles based on date, location, and category. It features a booking management system with calendar integration and inquiry forms for reservation requests. The design is responsive, ensuring consistent display across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Customizable sections allow modification of layouts, colors, typography, and page structures. It also supports integration with payment gateways and third-party booking tools. Additional elements include review sections, vehicle comparison tables, and image galleries. The code structure is optimized for performance and compatibility with common plugins used for rental and booking systems supporting scalable deployment and extensions ready."
    },
